* Reader shed: BOOST_OUT 12.6 V -> Q11 (P) -> reader (84 ohm = 150 mA). Q4 (N) from IO48 via R17.
.include models.inc
.param R18val=10k
Vb boost 0 12.6
V3 v33 0 3.3
Vio io48 0 3.3
R17 io48 q4g 100
R18 q4g v33 {R18val}
M4 q4d q4g 0 0 N7002 W=1 L=1
R51 q11g q4d 100k
R52 q11g boost 100k
M11 rdr q11g boost boost P3401 W=1 L=1
Rrdr rdr 0 84
.control
op
echo "IO48 high (reader on):" 
print v(rdr) v(q11g)
alter Vio dc=0
op
echo "IO48 low (shed):"
print v(rdr) v(q11g)
.endc
.end
